      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Dual Bot is a compact robot-themed play station from our Robo Romp series, with a robot-head canopy over the main deck and two slides coming off it. It comes in three colour pairs: Play Red and Baby Blue, Mango Yellow and Knight Blue, or Play Orange and Sea Green. The age group is 5+ and key users are 5 to 12, so it suits primary schools and societies with school-going children. Children climb to the deck and slide down, and the listed capacity is 15. The product area is 23'7\" x 18'6\". Galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope on Dual Bot are warranted for 3 years. Tell us which colour pair you prefer and we will send a quote with a layout."
